(text "IN100 insect tag v6: 7 mm round tag, wire antenna, cut-to-start tail" (at 25.4 167.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d49ab795-9484-438a-86fa-3b0b1d8aed4a))
(text "- U1 IN100 QFN18 (JLC C6062024). VDDQ tied to VCC; unused GPIOs, switches and RTC pins left open." (at 25.4 170.434 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 189ad5a1-476f-40c0-9414-0a88b53b26bd))
(text "- CHIP_EN: R1 1 Mohm pull-up on the tag. JP1 (OFF) on the tail, bridged after programming, holds it low;" (at 25.4 173.228 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f81ed4d1-1c62-48de-ae56-0971bf513b24))
(text "  cutting the tail releases CHIP_EN after VCC is up (datasheet power sequence). C2 10 nF (tail) delays it while programming." (at 25.4 176.022 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a06ac8e0-7bc9-4b22-9ada-139c59ab9bf8))
(text "- C1 47 uF 0603: carries the 9 mA TX bursts the 337 cell (~80 ohm) cannot supply alone. Use 0 dBm or less." (at 25.4 178.816 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 4fbe1d38-50d2-4102-b669-9853fd86767e))
(text "- Y1 26 MHz 1612, 7 pF load: the IN100's on-chip load capacitance replaces external caps." (at 25.4 181.61 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 49a9d03d-7bc9-4f65-8374-cad561eb7ae7))
(text "- AE1: ~30 mm enamelled wire in a plated hole, fed straight from RF_TX (trim to tune)." (at 25.4 184.404 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid dd156318-ffd1-4da2-8f63-c6372090835f))
(text "- BT1: 337 / SR416SW under the tag: - cap silver-epoxied to the underside pad, + wire in the plated hole." (at 25.4 187.198 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 516f297e-d0f8-43ab-9d82-44abfeace6b0))
(text "- J1: 2 x 2 plated pads on the tail (R T / G +). Program with 3.3 V before the cell is fitted." (at 25.4 189.992 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e636323c-719b-41cc-8a9d-209b5d07567f))
(text "Derived from the IN100 datasheet reference design and SparkFun's NanoBeacon Lite board (CC BY-SA 4.0)." (at 25.4 192.786 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e092b7a1-90de-4dd1-83c8-1bb8ea875efb))
